    "description": "Help FAQ: question 3"
  },
  "helpFaqQ3Answer": "It is either locked or disabled. Tap the lock icon on the card to unlock it. Disabled counters cannot be opened for counting.",
  "@helpFaqQ3Answer": {
    "description": "Help FAQ: answer 3"
  },
  "helpFaqQ4Title": "What happens if I stop in the middle of a mala?",
